This checkout has an independent Git history. Implement changes only in your own dedicated worktree. Read the meta workspace's `../../AGENTS.md` and this repo's own guidance before editing.

Paths relative to this checkout's root:

- Shared architecture/plans: `../../docs/`; tooling: `../../scripts/`.
- The seven application repos: `../../application/{app,www,api,player,cdn,docs,examples}.liforma.ai/`.
- Apple Silicon workflows: `../../ai-workflows/apple-silicon/` (tracked by the parent Git repo).
- Independent CUDA workflow repos: `../../ai-workflows/cuda/<repo>/`.
- Supporting repos such as Labs: `../../labs.liforma.ai/`.
- Obsolete my app: `../../legacy/my.liforma.ai/` (historical/migration work only).

Scope each search to the repo/subdirectory involved. If editor search cannot see another checkout, use Shell `rg` with its explicit path. Do not pipe `rg` to `head` or `tail`. Never edit another agent's primary checkout or share a writable dependency directory.
